They were fortunate enough to-- to grow up in a-- in a fairly-- in a-- in a Jewish-- [PAUSES FOR 3 SECONDS] you know, friends-- among many friends, in a city that has a fairly strong Jewish population, and-- and-- and influential population. So they have not experienced the antisemitism of an average European.

